OL,3,GNEWSACornwall FA submits plans for new
OL,4,AHQ and 3G pitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Football Association has
OL,7,Fsubmitted plans for a new 3G pitch,
OL,8,Fcommunity hub and headquarters.
OL,10,FA planning application was lodged with
OL,11,FCornwall Council to build the new
OL,12,Ffacility at Bodmin Town Football Club's
OL,13,FPriory Park ground.
OL,15,FThe association said there would be a
OL,16,F"phased approach" with the development
OL,17,Fof the pitch first, followed by the
OL,18,Fbuilding of the community hub, which
OL,19,Fwould also serve as its new
OL,20,Fheadquarters.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
