OL,3,GNEWSACornwall FA submits plans for new
OL,4,AHQ and 3G pitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall FA Chairman John Fabby said he
OL,7,Fwas "delighted" to reach the important
OL,8,Fmilestone and the FA would continue to
OL,9,Fwork closely with the football club to
OL,10,Fdeliver its "ambitions".
